      "message": "fix(ui): world gizmo hides Y on a lathe without a Y axis\n\nThe gizmo draws Z and X only on a lathe, and Y when the machine file\nstates a linear Y axis. A mill-turn keeps the milling frame and hides Y\nonly when its stated axes have none. Display only. Stacked on #2023.\n\nFixes #2019\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
